About Us

Komodo Consulting is a technology and strategy firm specializing in Digital Transformation. Operating in Portugal and Poland, we provide IT Consulting & Nearshore services. We support both public and private sector organizations through two main areas:


Consulting — with a focus on strategy, investment analysis, and digital process improvement;
IT Team Augmentation — helping clients scale and strengthen their tech teams.



The Project

We are seeking a Senior Data Scientist to work on a banking project for a Financial Company.

You will have the following responsibilities:


Own projects end-to-end, from initial data exploration and problem formulation through to modelling, evaluation, and handoff to the MLOps team for production deployment;
Engage directly with business stakeholders to understand requirements, translate them into data science problems, and present results clearly and effectively;
Develop and maintain clean, well-structured Python code, applying object-oriented programming principles and best practices;
Work with large-scale data stored in a Data Lake, leveraging PySpark and Databricks for data processing and model development;
Define and monitor model performance metrics, building dashboards to track model behaviour over time;
Manage the full lifecycle of assigned models, ensuring ongoing maintenance, iteration, and continuous improvement;
Contribute to GenAI initiatives alongside traditional Data Science projects, adapting fluidly between both contexts.



You need to have the following skills/experience:


Proven hands-on experience delivering end-to-end Data Science projects, from data exploration to solution deployment;
Strong Python skills, including object-oriented programming and the development of reusable, production-quality functions;
Experience with PySpark and big data processing environments;
Solid knowledge of Machine Learning and Deep Learning algorithms;
Strong foundation in exploratory data analysis and applied statistical methods;
Experience defining model monitoring strategies and building performance dashboards;
Ability to work autonomously and take full ownership of assigned projects, from requirements gathering to final delivery;
Strong communication skills, with experience engaging directly with business areas;
Experience with Databricks and MLflow is a plus;
Exposure to GenAI projects, even if partial, is valued.



Location

Oeiras (Hybrid - 3 days per week at the office).
